stateDiagram-v2
  direction TB
  [*] --> Idle
  Idle --> Membership

  state "Native membership lifecycle" as Membership {
    direction TB
    [*] --> Connecting
    Connecting --> Connected : membership verified
    Connected --> Reconnecting : transient transport failure
    Reconnecting --> Reconnecting : bounded retry
    Reconnecting --> Connected : successful null probe then admitted sync
  }

  Connecting --> Idle : error or cancellation
  Membership --> Idle : leave, revoke, kick, expiry or unauthorized

  note right of Idle
    Membership entry requires fresh checked consent and explicit create or join.
    No saved room credentials or automatic rejoin.
    A new join requires new checked consent.
  end note
  note right of Membership
    Native owner; one bounded sync worker.
    Leave clears credentials and samples immediately.
    Increment generation; discard late replies.
    Remote deletion and orphan cleanup are best effort.
    Room, match, team and freshness still gate each sample.
  end note
  note right of Reconnecting
    Resume samples only after the null recovery probe.
    Polling does not refresh an old observation.
  end note

